; Ethos-zero meta signal — the privileged configuration wire contract.
;
; The connection carries signal's exchange layer. A peer greets once,
; settling this contract by the digest of signal-ethos-zero's Library and
; this file; after that every query opens an exchange the peer names.
; Configure and Observe are answered with one frame on that exchange, which
; then ends. Subscribe answers on its exchange with each configuration or
; source change until the peer abandons the exchange.
Signal
[ signal_ethos_zero:[ RelativePath FileLocation ] ]
[ Configure.EthosNexusConfiguration
  Observe.ObservationSelection
  Subscribe.ObservationSelection
  Unsubscribe.ObservationSelection ]
[ Configured.EthosNexusConfiguration
  Observed.[ Configuration.EthosNexusConfiguration
             Sources.SourceIndex ]
  ConfigurationRejected.[ InvalidOrdinarySocketPath
                          InvalidMetaSocketPath
                          InvalidSourceManifestPath
                          InvalidRelativePath.RelativePath
                          UnreadableSourceManifest ]
  ConfigurationChanged.EthosNexusConfiguration
  SourcesChanged.SourceIndex ]
[ EthosNexusConfiguration.{ OrdinarySocketPath.String
                            MetaSocketPath.String
                            SourceManifestPath.String }
  ObservationSelection.[ Configuration Sources ]
  SourceIndex.Vector<FileLocation> ]
